# Fullscreen display from the main menu with LbaWinFullScreen: 0 in
# lba.cfg (fixtures/fullwin: the CD's LBA.CFG and that line), which the
# port starts in a window. The option menu's seventh entry says
# Fullscreen display: OFF, and Return turns it ON and writes 1 to
# lba.cfg. The first entry goes back to the main menu. Keys are short,
# as in options.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot off
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot on
key Up Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot main
